OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, with
OL,5,Aauthor due to speak to BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the review concludes the rise in
OL,8,Fmental health problems that has been
OL,9,Fseen among young people is real ` and
OL,10,Fsays there needs to be better support
OL,11,Ffor all conditions
OL,13,FMany young people "have a weight on
OL,14,Ftheir shoulders with regards to
OL,15,Finclusion" and feel "like a square peg
OL,16,Fin a round hole", a child
OL,17,Fpsychotherapist tells the BBC
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
